{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local llm memory allocation local llm memory allocation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","fileName":"Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local LLM Memory Allocation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local LLM Network Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","Local LLM Hardware Sizing","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local llm memory allocation local llm memory allocation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","fileName":"Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local LLM Memory Allocation","heading":"Local LLM Memory Allocation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Container memory allocation places an enforceable boundary around a local model service. If the limit is too low, requests stall or fail under pressure; increasing it may restore inference while reducing resources available to the interface and other applications.\n\nThe limit should be changed from observed behavior and host capacity, not raised without bound. Container statistics, response latency, and failure logs show whether memory is the constraint. [[Local LLM Hardware Sizing]] sets the overall budget, while per-service allocation prevents one model from silently exhausting the entire host.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","Local LLM Hardware Sizing","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local llm memory allocation local llm memory allocation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","fileName":"Local LLM Memory Allocation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local LLM Memory Allocation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","Local LLM Hardware Sizing","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}